# Contract Naming

Same keys across FE schema, service params, API, BE DTO, DB, pivot payloads.

Cross-repo only when `platform-repos` has `groups.*.contract` `{ frontend, backend }` — resolve those two roots only (`legacy/project-config.md`). Else workspace-only + say FE↔BE unavailable. Never paste full map.

- No rename layers (`content` not `content_blog`)
- No flatten `auth: { id, name }` → `auth_id`, `auth_name`
- M-N under relationship keys; third-party mapping only at adapter + documented reason

```ts
// Good: { content, auth: { id, name } }
// Bad:  { content_blog, auth_id, auth_name }
```
